  "description": "A multi-temporal geospatial foundation model trained on 4.2M global time series samples from NASA?s Harmonized Landsat and Sentinel-2 data archive at 30m resolution. Incorporates temporal and location embeddings for enhanced performance across diverse EO tasks. Available in 300M and 600M parameter versions.",
